{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03768","headline":"和韦承庆过义阳公主山池五首 三 · 杜审言","name":"和韦承庆过义阳公主山池五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"携琴遶碧沙，摇笔弄青霞。\n杜若幽庭草，芙蓉曲沼花。\n宴游成野客，形胜得仙家。\n往往留仙步，登攀日易斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜审言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03768.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03768","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}